<div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="shop-title">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/0221/3593/files/Logo_Preferente_Color_Positivo_-_INALTUM.png" style="width: 150px; height: 50px;">
      </div>
      <div class="order-title">
        <p class="order-number">
          Orden {{ order.name }}
        </p>
        {% assign mes = "Enero, Febrero, Marzo, Abril, Mayo, Junio, Julio, Agosto, Septiembre, Octubre, Noviembre, Diciembre" | split: "," %}
        {% assign fecha = order.created_at | date: "%d/%m/%Y" | split: "/" %}
        {% assign index = fecha[1] | minus: 1 %}
        <p class="text-align-right">
            {{ fecha[0] }} de {{ mes[index] }} del {{ fecha[2] }}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {% comment %}
      ============================================================
      DATOS EMPRESA (RUT / ORDEN DE COMPRA)
      ------------------------------------------------------------
      Estos valores vienen de los "atributos" que el cliente completa
      en el checkout. Ajusta los nombres entre comillas ("RUT",
      "Orden de Compra", etc.) para que coincidan EXACTO con los
      nombres de tus campos en Shopify. Si un pedido no trae el dato,
      simplemente no se muestra.
      ============================================================
    {% endcomment %}
    {% assign rut = order.attributes["RUT"] | default: order.attributes["Rut"] | default: order.attributes["rut"] %}
    {% assign razon_social = order.attributes["Razon Social"] | default: order.attributes["Razón Social"] | default: shipping_address.company %}
    {% assign oc = order.attributes["Orden de Compra"] | default: order.attributes["OC"] | default: order.attributes["Numero OC"] %}

    <div class="dispatch-box">
      <div class="dispatch-recipient">
        <p class="subtitle-bold to-uppercase dispatch-title">Destinatario</p>
        <p class="address-detail">
          {% if shipping_address != blank %}
            <span class="dest-name">{{ shipping_address.name }}</span>
            {% if razon_social != blank %}
              <br>
              <strong>Empresa:</strong> {{ razon_social }}
            {% endif %}
            {% if rut != blank %}
              <br>
              <strong>RUT:</strong> {{ rut }}
            {% endif %}
            <br>
            <span class="dest-address">
              <strong>Dirección:</strong> {{ shipping_address.address1 }}
              {% if shipping_address.address2 != blank %}, {{ shipping_address.address2 }}{% endif %}
            </span>
            {% if shipping_address.city != blank %}
              <br>
              <strong>Comuna:</strong> {{ shipping_address.city }}
            {% endif %}
            {% if shipping_address.province != blank %}
              <br>
              <strong>Región:</strong> {{ shipping_address.province }}
            {% endif %}
            <br>
            <strong>País:</strong> {{ shipping_address.country }}
            {% if shipping_address.phone != blank %}
              <br>
              <strong>Teléfono:</strong> {{ shipping_address.phone }}
            {% endif %}
          {% else %}
            No hay dirección de entrega
          {% endif %}
        </p>
        {% if oc != blank %}
          <p class="dispatch-oc">
            <span class="dispatch-oc-label">Orden de Compra</span>
            <span class="dispatch-oc-value">{{ oc }}</span>
          </p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% comment %}
        El N° de bulto es un dato físico del despacho y Shopify no lo
        conoce, por eso queda como recuadro GRANDE para completar a mano
        con plumón en bodega y que el reparto lo lea sin confusión.
      {% endcomment %}
      <div class="dispatch-bultos">
        <span class="dispatch-bultos-label">N° de Bulto</span>
        <span class="dispatch-bultos-value">___ de ___</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {% comment %}
      Remitente: va justo debajo del destinatario para que, al doblar la
      hoja por esta zona, queden destinatario + remitente a la vista y el
      detalle de productos quede oculto al reparto.
    {% endcomment %}
    <div class="sender-box">
      <p class="subtitle-bold to-uppercase sender-title">Remitente</p>
      <p class="sender-detail">
        <strong>{{ shop.name }}</strong>
        <br>
        RUT 76.520.639-1
        <br>
        {{ shop_address.summary }}
        <br>
        Tel: 569 9376 7892
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="thanks">
      <p>
        <strong>Gracias por tu compra.</strong>
        <br>
        Descarga tu Boleta o Factura en https://www.inaltum.cl/pages/portal-documentos-inaltum
      </p>
    </div>

    {% if order.note != blank %}
      <div class="notes">
        <p class="subtitle-bold to-uppercase">
          Notas
        </p>
        <p class="notes-details">
          {{ order.note }}
        </p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if delivery_method.instructions != blank %}
      <div class="notes">
        <p class="subtitle-bold to-uppercase">
          Instrucciones de entrega
        </p>
        <p class="notes-details">
          {{ delivery_method.instructions }}
        </p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <p class="dest-contact">
      <strong>Web:</strong> {{ shop.email }}
      <br>
      <strong>Empresas:</strong> b2b@inaltum.cl &nbsp;·&nbsp; mercadopublico@inaltum.cl
      <br>
      {{ shop.domain }}
    </p>

    <hr>
    <div class="order-container">
      <div class="order-container-header">
        <div class="order-container-header-left-content">
          <p class="subtitle-bold to-uppercase">
            Artículos
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="order-container-header-right-content">
          <p class="subtitle-bold to-uppercase">
            Cantidad
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {% comment %}
      To adjust the size of line item images, change desired_image_size.
      The other variables make sure your images print at high quality.
      {% endcomment %}
      {% assign desired_image_size = 58 %}
      {% assign resolution_adjusted_size = desired_image_size | times: 300 | divided_by: 72 | ceil %}
      {% capture effective_image_dimensions %}
        {{ resolution_adjusted_size }}x{{ resolution_adjusted_size }}
      {% endcapture %}

      {% for line_item in line_items_in_shipment %}
        <div class="flex-line-item">
          <div class="flex-line-item-img">
            {% if line_item.image != blank %}
              <div class="aspect-ratio aspect-ratio-square" style="width: {{ desired_image_size }}px; height: {{ desired_image_size }}px;">
                {{ line_item.image | img_url: effective_image_dimensions | img_tag: '', 'aspect-ratio__content' }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="flex-line-item-description">
            <p>
              <span class="line-item-description-line">
                {{ line_item.title }}
              </span>
              {% if line_item.variant_title != blank %}
                <span class="line-item-description-line">
                  {{ line_item.variant_title }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
              {% if line_item.sku != blank %}
                <span class="line-item-description-line">
                  SKU: {{ line_item.sku }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-line-item-quantity">
            <p class="text-align-right">
              {{ line_item.shipping_quantity }} de {{ line_item.quantity }}
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% unless includes_all_line_items_in_order %}
      <hr class="subdued-separator">
      <p class="missing-line-items-text ">
        Hay otros productos de tu orden que no se incluyen en este despacho.
      </p>
    {% endunless %}
</div>
<style type="text/css">
    body {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .wrapper {
      width: 831px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 4em;
      font-family: "Noto Sans", sans-serif;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .header {
      width: 100%;
      display: -webkit-box;
      display: -webkit-flex;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .header p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .shop-title {
      -webkit-box-flex: 6;
      -webkit-flex: 6;
      flex: 6;
      font-size: 1.9em;
    }

    .order-title {
      -webkit-box-flex: 4;
      -webkit-flex: 4;
      flex: 4;
    }

    .order-number {
      text-align: right;
      font-size: 2em;
      font-weight: bold;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin: 0 0 0.1em;
    }

    .address-detail {
      margin: 0.7em 0 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .subtitle-bold {
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.85em;
    }

    .to-uppercase {
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .text-align-right {
      text-align: right;
    }

    /* ---- Bloque de despacho destacado (~40% de la hoja carta) ---- */
    .dispatch-box {
      display: -webkit-box;
      display: -webkit-flex;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: stretch;
      border: 3px solid black;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin: 1.5em 0;
      min-height: 420px;
    }

    .dispatch-recipient {
      -webkit-box-flex: 3;
      -webkit-flex: 3;
      flex: 3;
      padding: 1.2em 1.4em;
      display: -webkit-box;
      display: -webkit-flex;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .dispatch-title {
      font-size: 1.1em;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
      padding-bottom: 0.4em;
    }

    .dispatch-recipient .address-detail {
      font-size: 1.25em;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .dest-name {
      font-size: 1.6em;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .dest-address {
      font-size: 1.15em;
    }

    .dispatch-oc {
      margin: auto 0 0;
      padding-top: 0.8em;
      border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
    }

    .dispatch-oc-label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.8em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #555;
    }

    .dispatch-oc-value {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.6em;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 0.1em;
    }

    /* ---- Recuadro N° de Bulto: MUY grande para escribir con plumón ---- */
    .dispatch-bultos {
      -webkit-box-flex: 2;
      -webkit-flex: 2;
      flex: 2;
      border-left: 3px solid black;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      display: -webkit-box;
      display: -webkit-flex;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0.6em;
    }

    .dispatch-bultos-label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.6em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.25em;
    }

    .dispatch-bultos-value {
      display: block;
      font-size: 5em;
      font-weight: bold;
      line-height: 1.1;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .dest-contact {
      margin: 0.8em 0 0;
      padding-top: 0.6em;
      border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
      font-size: 0.95em;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #333;
    }

    /* ---- Remitente (justo bajo el destinatario, para doblar) ---- */
    .sender-box {
      border: 1px solid #999;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 0.9em 1.2em;
      margin: 0 0 1.5em;
    }

    .sender-title {
      font-size: 0.9em;
      color: #555;
      margin-bottom: 0.4em;
    }

    .sender-detail {
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.5;
      font-size: 1.05em;
    }

    .order-container {
      padding: 0 0.7em;
    }

    .order-container-header {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 1.4em;
    }

    .order-container-header-left-content {
      float: left;
    }

    .order-container-header-right-content {
      float: right;
    }

    .flex-line-item {
      display: -webkit-box;
      display: -webkit-flex;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      margin: 1.4em 0;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .flex-line-item-img {
      margin-right: 1.4em;
      min-width: {{ desired_image_size }}px;
    }

    .flex-line-item-description {
      -webkit-box-flex: 7;
      -webkit-flex: 7;
      flex: 7;
    }

    .line-item-description-line {
      display: block;
    }

    .flex-line-item-description p {
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .flex-line-item-quantity {
      -webkit-box-flex: 3;
      -webkit-flex: 3;
      flex: 3;
    }

    .subdued-separator {
      height: 0.07em;
      border: none;
      color: lightgray;
      background-color: lightgray;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .missing-line-items-text {
      margin: 1.4em 0;
      padding: 0 0.7em;
    }

    .notes {
      margin-top: 1.5em;
    }

    .notes p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .notes .notes-details {
      margin-top: 0.7em;
    }

    .thanks {
      margin: 0 0 1.5em;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .thanks p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    hr {
      height: 0.14em;
      border: none;
      color: black;
      background-color: black;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .aspect-ratio {
      position: relative;
      display: block;
      background: #fafbfc;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .aspect-ratio::before {
      z-index: 1;
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      border: 1px solid rgba(195,207,216,0.3);
    }

    .aspect-ratio--square {
      width: 100%;
      padding-bottom: 100%;
    }

    .aspect-ratio__content {
      position: absolute;
      max-width: 100%;
      max-height: 100%;
      display: block;
      top: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      margin: auto;
    }
</style>
